TWxENjBsYVlsV3BBNjJJdC1FQTZPdXh0X3pVMm80WU85T0tieWdUY3hqSXhEdHhYWk8wTlRWQWZ2SnM3engtZl9NZzdzUHpueWlhM1dfQl9MazIx?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Meta Platforms 第三季獲利、營收成長； Q4 指引"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":5},{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-01-29","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1326801/000162828026003942/meta-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Our products enable people to connect and share through mobile devices, personal computers, virtual reality (VR) headsets, and AI glasses. We are innovating in artificial intelligence (AI) technologies to build transformative experiences and capabilities across our Family of Apps and new platforms, and to advance our vision to deliver personal superintelligence for everyone.","zh":"我們的產品使人們能夠透過行動裝置、個人電腦、虛擬實境 (VR) 耳機和人工智慧眼鏡進行連接和共享。我們正在人工智慧 (AI) 技術方面進行創新，以在我們的應用程式系列和新平台上建立變革性的體驗和功能，並推進我們為每個人提供個人超級智慧的願景。"},{"en":"We build technology that helps people connect and share, find and build communities, and grow businesses. We also help people discover and learn about what is going on in the world around them, enable people to share their experiences, ideas, photos, videos, and other content with audiences ranging from their closest family members and friends to the public at large, and stay connected everywhere by accessing our products. Meta is moving our offerings beyond 2D screens toward immersive experiences like augmented and virtual reality to help build the next computing platform. Our vision does not center on any single product, but rather an entire ecosystem of experiences, devices, and new technologies powered by AI. While the metaverse is in the very early stages of its development, we believe it will become the next computing platform and the future of social interaction.","zh":"我們開發的技術可以幫助人們聯繫和分享、尋找和建立社區以及發展業務。我們也幫助人們發現和了解周圍世界正在發生的事情，使人們能夠與從最親密的家人和朋友到廣大公眾的受眾分享他們的經驗、想法、照片、影片和其他內容，並透過造訪我們的產品在任何地方保持聯繫。 Meta 正在將我們的產品從 2D 螢幕轉向擴增實境和虛擬實境等沉浸式體驗，以幫助建立下一個運算平台。我們的願景並不集中在任何單一產品，而是以人工智慧為動力的體驗、設備和新技術的整個生態系統。雖然虛擬宇宙還處於發展的早期階段，但我們相信它將成為下一個運算平台和社交互動的未來。"},{"en":"Across our work, we are innovating to build new experiences that help make our platform more social, useful, and immersive. Our AI investments support initiatives across our products and services, helping power the systems that rank content in our apps, our discovery engine that recommends relevant content, the tools advertisers use to reach customers, the development of new generative AI experiences, and the tools that make our product development more efficient and productive. We are also working to develop the next generation of AI models and advance our vision to build superintelligence, which we define as AI that surpasses human intelligence. Although it is inherently difficult to predict when superintelligence may be achieved, we are investing now because we believe this has the potential to begin a new era of individual empowerment, where people can direct superintelligence toward","zh":"在我們的工作中，我們不斷創新，打造新的體驗，幫助我們的平台變得更加社交、實用和身臨其境。我們的人工智慧投資支援我們的產品和服務計劃，幫助驅動對應用程式內容進行排名的系統、推薦相關內容的發現引擎、廣告商用來接觸客戶的工具、新的生成式人工智慧體驗的開發以及使我們的產品開發更加高效和富有成效的工具。我們也致力於開發下一代人工智慧模型，並推動我們建立超級智慧的願景，我們將超級智慧定義為超越人類智慧的人工智慧。儘管預測何時可以實現超級智慧本質上是困難的，但我們現在正在投資，因為我們相信這有可能開啟個人賦權的新時代，人們可以將超級智慧引導到"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Our business is characterized by innovation, rapid change, and disruptive technologies. We compete with companies providing connection, sharing, discovery, and communication products and services to users online, as well as companies that sell advertising to businesses looking to reach consumers and/or develop tools and systems for managing and optimizing advertising campaigns. We face significant competition in every aspect of our business, including, but not limited to, companies that facilitate the ability of users to create, share, communicate, and discover content and information online or enable marketers to reach their existing or prospective audiences. We compete to attract, engage, and retain people who use our products, to attract and retain businesses that use our free or paid business and advertising services, and to attract and retain developers who build compelling applicat","zh":"我們業務的特點是創新、快速變化和顛覆性技術。我們與向線上用戶提供連接、共享、發現和通訊產品和服務的公司以及向希望接觸消費者和/或開發用於管理和優化廣告活動的工具和系統的企業銷售廣告的公司競爭。我們在業務的各個方面都面臨著激烈的競爭，包括但不限於促進用戶在線上創建、分享、交流和發現內容和資訊的能力或使行銷人員能夠接觸現有或潛在受眾的公司。我們競相吸引、吸引和留住使用我們產品的用戶，吸引和留住使用我們免費或付費業務和廣告服務的企業，並吸引和留住開發引人注目的應用程式的開發人員。"},{"en":"Our product development philosophy centers on continuous innovation in creating and improving products that are social by design, which means that our products are designed to place people and their social interactions at the core of the product experience. Historically, the increases in our computing needs have been driven by growth in our user base as well as engagement with products like video and VR. Our increased efforts toward building frontier AI models have driven a significant further expansion in our computing needs and we expect our computing needs to continue to expand as a result. We have designed and built our own data centers and key portions of our technical infrastructure, and a substantial portion of our technical infrastructure is also provided by third parties. Our ability to provide and continue to innovate our products and services depends on the continued availabil","zh":"我們的產品開發理念以不斷創新為中心，創造和改進設計社交化的產品，這意味著我們的產品旨在將人及其社交互動置於產品體驗的核心。從歷史上看，我們計算需求的成長是由用戶群的成長以及影片和 VR 等產品的參與所推動的。我們在建構前沿人工智慧模型所做的努力推動了我們的運算需求進一步顯著擴大，我們預期我們的運算需求將因此繼續擴大。我們設計和建造了自己的資料中心和技術基礎設施的關鍵部分，而我們的技術基礎設施的很大一部分也是由第三方提供的。我們提供並持續創新我們的產品和服務的能力取決於持續的可用性"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Family Of Apps","val":198759000000,"zh":"應用程式家族"},{"name":"Reality Labs","val":2207000000,"zh":"現實實驗室"}],"total":200966000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US Canada","val":78866000000,"zh":"美國 加拿大"},{"name":"US","val":74780000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":53817000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Europe","val":46569000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Rest Of World","val":21714000000,"zh":"世界其他地區"}],"total":200966000000}},"peers":["AAPL","AMZN","GOOG","TSLA","NFLX"]}}